# The Route 212 move tutor (decomp scrcmd_move_tutor.c): the cost board by the door (every move there, its shard
# costs in a window), then the tutor: Knock Off (4 Red, 4 Blue) is refused without Red Shards; Fury Cutter (8 Blue)
# replaces Tackle (the summary's forget pick), and the shards are paid.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BULBASAUR 30 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE platinum:MOVE_GROWL platinum:MOVE_VINE_WHIP platinum:MOVE_LEECH_SEED
give item platinum:ITEM_BLUE_SHARD 8
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_212_HOUSE 4 3 up
until idle
# The board: the list of Route 212's moves, the first one's costs, A closes the window.
+0 press a
+1 release a
until menu
+4 screenshot tutor-board
+0 press a
+1 release a
+10 screenshot shard-cost
+0 press a
+1 release a
until idle
# The tutor: Knock Off, the list's second move, needs Red Shards: refused.
+0 press down
until position 4 6
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press right
+1 release right
until idle
+0 assert facing player right
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party
+1 tap slot:0
until app none
until menu
+4 press down
+1 release down
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves[0] "platinum:MOVE_TACKLE"
# Fury Cutter, the first: four moves known, the summary forgets Tackle.
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party
+1 tap slot:0
until app none
until menu
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app summary
+4 screenshot tutor-forget
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app none
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_FURY_CUTTER","platinum:MOVE_GROWL","platinum:MOVE_VINE_WHIP","platinum:MOVE_LEECH_SEED"]
+0 assert state party[0].pp[0] 20
+0 assert state bag.items []
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves[0] "platinum:MOVE_FURY_CUTTER"
